{title: Kitida Navyane Tula Aathavave}
{artist: Mandar Apte Arya Ambekar}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#]Kitida Navyane Tule Aath [F#]vave,        [G#]Dolyatale Paani Navyane [C#]Wahave
[G#]Kitida Zurave, Tuzyach [D#m]sathi,        [B]Kitida Mhanave [F#]tuze geet othi
[G#]Kitida sukun, punhaa [C#]fulave,        [C#]Kiti haak dyavi, [D#m]Tuzya manala
[F#]Kiti thambavave, mi [G#]mazya [C#]dilala,        [B]Kitida raduni, [F#]jivane [G#]hasave
[C#]Kitida Navyane Tule Aath [F#]vave,        [G#]Dolyatale Paani Navyane [C#]Wahave
